---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
const crumbs = [{ name: 'Privacy Policy', path: '/privacy-policy/' }];
const updated = '19 November 2026';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy | The Samsaara Club & Resort" description="How The Samsaara Club & Resort collects and uses information from website enquiries and analytics." breadcrumbs={crumbs}>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-x max-w-3xl prose-s">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-charcoal/60">Last updated: {updated}</p>
      <p>This policy explains how {site.name} (“we”, “us”) handles information when you visit thesamsaara.com or contact us.</p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Enquiry form:</strong> your name, phone number, travel dates, number of guests, enquiry type and message. This is sent to our email ({site.email}) through Web3Forms, a form-delivery service.</li>
        <li><strong>WhatsApp and calls:</strong> if you message or call us, we receive your number and the content you share, under WhatsApp’s and your telecom provider’s own terms.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> we use Google Analytics to understand how visitors use the site (pages viewed, device type, approximate location, and clicks on WhatsApp, call and form buttons). Google may set cookies for this.</li>
        <li><strong>Embedded maps:</strong> the Google Map on our pages is provided by Google and is subject to Google’s privacy policy.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>We use your details only to respond to your enquiry, prepare a quote, manage your booking and, if you stay with us, to ask for feedback. We do not sell your information.</p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>We keep enquiry details for as long as needed to handle your enquiry and booking, and for our accounting and legal records.</p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can ask us to see, correct or delete the personal information we hold about you by emailing {site.email} or messaging {site.phone}. You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>{site.name}, {site.address.street}, {site.address.locality}, {site.address.region} {site.address.postalCode}. Email: {site.email}. Phone: {site.phone}.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
